NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY CONTENT
This repository reproduces excerpts of OSCAL content published by Amazon Web
Services, IBM and Easy Dynamics, and excerpts of the OSCAL schemas published by
NIST, for the purpose of technical comparison and commentary. Those excerpts
remain under their original licenses and copyright. Each excerpt records its
source file and JSON pointer in data/provenance.json.

